# REGRESSION (`todo/t0841`, R48 Track D1) — GRADUATED from
# `known_gaps/comprehension_invariant_owned_body_double_free.gg`.
#
# A COMPREHENSION IS A LOOP. `[s for i in 0..3]` evaluates `s` once per
# iteration exactly as `for i in 0..3: parts.push(s)` does, and the accumulate
# is a consuming position, so the compiler contract applies unchanged —
# AGENTS.md § "Ownership at Consuming Positions": *"Borrow, OR owned but live
# past this call → clone before call"*.
#
# The defect was in the liveness PRODUCER, not the accumulate: the three
# comprehension arms of `src/ir/lowering/liveness.rs` recorded last-use in a
# SINGLE pass while the statement-loop arms did a two-pass back-edge dance, so
# `s` — the loop-invariant body — was marked dead at its only syntactic use and
# MOVED on every iteration. Three aliases of one heap buffer landed in the
# vector and the array's free ran the string destructor three times on it.
#
# AXIS CELL: comprehension kind = LIST · body sub-position = ELEMENT ·
# source = RANGE · element type = String (heap-forced).
#
# RED-VERIFIED at pre-fix HEAD, both lanes: build rc 0, run rc 134,
# `free(): double free detected in tcache 2` (C and `--backend=llvm`);
# under `--sanitize`, `AddressSanitizer: attempting double-free` in
# `__gorget_global_dealloc_fn` <- `gorget_string_free` <- `gorget_array_free`.
#
# ⚠ THE PAYLOAD MUST BE HEAP-FORCED (`mk("a","b")`, not a literal) or the
# double free is invisible: a literal is an immortal `.rodata` view with no
# destructor to run twice.
#
# ⚠ THE AXIS IS NARROWER THAN "LOOP-INVARIANT BODY" — the discriminator is an
# already-owned live NAME, not a fresh call result. The control is
# `cow_comprehension_fresh_mint_control.gg` (`[mk("t","ag") for n in nums]`),
# green before AND after. ⚠ `known_gaps/map_inline_closure_cross_type_input_mint.gg`
# is NOT that control: it is a `.map()` fixture and it is RED at HEAD.
#
# ⚠ NOT `todo/t0003`. That family's axis is the ACCUMULATOR'S ELEMENT TYPE —
# the result element minted from the source element's size/destructor — and one
# of its recorded symptoms crashes in these very frames by DESTRUCTOR
# INHERITANCE. Here nothing is mis-minted: the element type is right and the
# values are right, and the program would print the correct answer if it did
# not free three times. Same frames, different cause.

String mk(String a, String b):
    return a + b

void main():
    String s = mk("a", "b")
    Vector[String] parts = [s for i in 0..3]
    print("".join(parts))
